d": "600769042344423", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75367595_600769045677756_4184331693265155160_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i5jvf2o1t_sQ7kNvwF8CxVY&_nc_oc=AdrkrZvCjwak0AagAYQUrgwWTNgVolOGSUt8LIIlaRe_EFKGLmflIHw7gLWWd6U-mJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJYbSzJu3rN6Dt0Jk-J7fOfJpVVqrKnK-fQm_aGBN5n2g&oe=6AA0212F"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (5).png", "id": "511803525221127", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031608_511803535221126_6449582359268280911_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ifc7AwHKaA4Q7kNvwHQ3Th8&_nc_oc=AdpQoLTE4KL8Xur4fMiaWF9JBOuVXVbrAzLNw__YP_6n75zN3LJp4Jg-B3_6BUaJO2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJp9S2aK787TnGQtf5lRCNOWzPWE1zvQ_ah4wZhjXmwTQ&oe=6AA02598"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (6).png", "id": "1380952959552847", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003258_1380952966219513_7539545808247244132_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qQepXOm8cDUQ7kNvwFFA9AY&_nc_oc=AdqQJq1DztEnv1eVQoGGlQWeJGHazR3l5KRnCEgPvsqjvj4HDK-xjdHFnLPCrrCPGJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvlWsKjVpAajW9IZvCtbbfN11PUQRV55pm3JGfqsdVrw&oe=6A9FFABC"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (10).png", "id": "2014764132301448", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451776_2014764135634781_3715488626808879103_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J2JsIiKJuUAQ7kNvwFokL-L&_nc_oc=Adr_6goh0bHIKUn7e7YGA4wrxlsMdAsKYbmAdDfn7WEN85sLriV3mlqldhmiXXEgecU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIgXKAYoS6u0HzYzeZ7DUww3FNM9Lc4rBS1p3VUGeukXw&oe=6AA0052B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "593570069731482", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974502_593570076398148_755855805457355311_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v_O7MxfKMh8Q7kNvwEF3ho-&_nc_oc=AdoRVXk7NTUSJ48CBqugodl629Y77RTM1poVeZ7XxeHXmuY_GGu5HALWGaTFVyS33kY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIuW-xT1SjZirGxrmgEQBFqiWOY7am2lx9bTmMRgBpplg&oe=6AA02C90"}, "display_name": "EduVR", "keywords": ["education", "school", "workshop", "modern"], "long_description": "## Revolutionizing Education with Virtual Reality  \n\n**EduVR** is a modular educational VR application designed for schools, offering a new way to engage students in learning. Teachers and students become part of realistic simulations and practical tasks that promote active learning, safe experimentation, and a better understanding of complex topics.  \n\n---\n\n## **Key Features**  \n\n- **Modular System:** Covers a wide range of subjects and disciplines, with new modules regularly added.  \n- **Easy to Use:** No need for a powerful PC \u2013 EduVR runs directly on Meta Quest.  \n- **Safe Learning:** Simulate situations that can't be safely performed in traditional classrooms (e.g., safety training).  \n- **Interactive:** 5\u201310 minute tasks and simulations, ideal for integration into regular lessons.  \n- **Progress Tracking:** Teachers can monitor students\u2019 progress and provide personalized feedback.  \n\n---\n\n## **Benefits for Schools**  \n\n- **Engaging Lessons:** Virtual reality increases students\u2019 interest in learning and enhances their skills.  \n- **Cost Savings:** Vocational schools can simulate working with expensive materials and equipment.  \n- **Flexibility:** Adaptable to different subjects and age groups.  \n- **Practical Applications:** Prepares students for real-life scenarios in a safe and efficient way.  \n\n---\n\n## **Try it for Free**  \n\nDownload the free version of EduVR and access a new module every 14 days. Discover how EduVR can transform education at your school and get started today!  ", "short_description": "Transform your classroom with EduVR, the modular educational VR app 